WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.012 --> 00:00:17.875
The whole kingdom was talking about how the royal wedding had been called off.

2
00:00:19.195 --> 00:00:22.478
Everyone was shocked and wondered what was going to happen.

3
00:00:23.639 --> 00:00:25.860
So Aladdin sent his mother to the palace.

4
00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:33.685
"That woman is back," the grand vizier said to the sultan.

5
00:00:33.705 --> 00:00:40.127
"Do you remember, my lord, how you joked that the princess would marry her son?"

6
00:00:43.148 --> 00:00:44.268
The vizier laughed.

7
00:00:46.128 --> 00:00:48.669
The sultan looked at Zeba in her plain dress.

8
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.290
"I do remember."

9
00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.451
The sultan seemed troubled.

10
00:00:53.471 --> 00:00:55.771
"I made a promise.

11
00:00:56.292 --> 00:00:57.572
Bring the woman forward."

12
00:00:59.456 --> 00:01:01.718
Zeba bowed to the sultan as before.

13
00:01:01.738 --> 00:01:08.522
"Oh great sultan, I have come to remind you of your promise."

14
00:01:10.463 --> 00:01:16.968
The grand vizier whispered into the sultan's ear, "My lord, see how poor she is.

15
00:01:17.568 --> 00:01:20.490
Princess Badra cannot marry her son!"

16
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.412
"This problem is your fault.

17
00:01:24.553 --> 00:01:28.876
Your son is so unpleasant," the sultan whispered back angrily.

18
00:01:30.116 --> 00:01:33.700
"Nobody would want to marry him—especially my daughter!"

19
00:01:35.521 --> 00:01:38.084
The adviser spoke into the sultan's ear again.

20
00:01:38.104 --> 00:01:40.146
"That's impossible!"

21
00:01:40.706 --> 00:01:41.667
shouted the sultan.

22
00:01:42.748 --> 00:01:45.190
But after thinking a moment, he smiled.

23
00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.572
"Yes, it is impossible."

24
00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.715
The sultan then turned to Zeba.

25
00:01:50.735 --> 00:01:55.380
"Tell Aladdin that I remember my promise," he said.

26
00:01:57.228 --> 00:02:00.950
"But first, he must do something special to be worthy of the princess.

27
00:02:02.351 --> 00:02:06.954
Aladdin must send me twenty warriors carrying twenty bowls made of pure gold.

28
00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:11.116
Each bowl must be filled with sparkling jewels.

29
00:02:12.557 --> 00:02:16.099
When Aladdin has done this, Princess Badra will be his."

30
00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:23.864
The sultan smiled at the grand vizier, and Zeba frowned, bowed, and left the hall.

31
00:02:25.116 --> 00:02:27.878
Aladdin's mother walked home, shaking her head.

32
00:02:27.898 --> 00:02:32.140
"How can my son do what the sultan asks?

33
00:02:33.281 --> 00:02:36.522
Can he return to the enchanted treasury and pick more jewels?"

34
00:02:37.143 --> 00:02:37.763
She sighed.

35
00:02:37.783 --> 00:02:43.566
"And where will he find twenty warriors?"

36
00:02:43.586 --> 00:02:48.909
"I told you this wouldn't work," said Zeba when she got home.

37
00:02:48.929 --> 00:02:53.332
"The son of a tailor cannot marry a sultan's daughter."

38
00:02:54.348 --> 00:02:57.910
Then she told Aladdin everything that had happened in the sultan's hall.

39
00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:01.351
"It's all the fault of that grand vizier!"

40
00:03:01.971 --> 00:03:03.792
she cried with a shake of her fist.

41
00:03:05.593 --> 00:03:07.113
Aladdin just laughed.

42
00:03:08.814 --> 00:03:13.236
"Mother," he said, "the sultan thinks that he has asked for an impossible thing.

43
00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:15.697
But it's not impossible!"

44
00:03:15.717 --> 00:03:17.598
"It's not?"

45
00:03:18.158 --> 00:03:19.058
replied Zeba.

46
00:03:19.078 --> 00:03:21.459
"It's easy!"

47
00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:22.700
said Aladdin.

48
00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:26.997
"Go to the bazaar and buy us something special for our evening meal.

49
00:03:28.098 --> 00:03:30.319
While you are gone, I will take care of everything."

50
00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.280
Zeba did as he asked.

51
00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:39.083
When she returned, she found twenty warriors crowded into her little house.

52
00:03:40.163 --> 00:03:45.966
Each one held a bowl of pure gold, and each bowl was full of jewels!

53
00:03:45.986 --> 00:03:49.427
"The genie did this!"

54
00:03:50.128 --> 00:03:50.708
she cried.

55
00:03:51.992 --> 00:03:55.014
"Thanks be to God for the wonderful lamp!"

56
00:03:56.215 --> 00:04:00.278
Aladdin opened the door and sent the warriors out into the street.

57
00:04:01.839 --> 00:04:05.962
"Now, Mother," said Aladdin, "I want you to go to the palace one more time.

58
00:04:07.063 --> 00:04:08.744
Deliver these warriors to the sultan."

59
00:04:11.226 --> 00:04:15.269
Zeba led the twenty warriors to the palace and into the sultan's hall.

60
00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:19.852
They all bowed to the sultan and set their bowls before him.

61
00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.441
"And now what do you say, Grand Vizier?"

62
00:04:23.881 --> 00:04:24.802
the sultan asked.

63
00:04:24.822 --> 00:04:27.963
"Is Aladdin worthy of my daughter?"

64
00:04:29.864 --> 00:04:32.045
The sultan's adviser was speechless.

65
00:04:32.065 --> 00:04:34.506
"Hear me, good woman!"

66
00:04:34.946 --> 00:04:36.307
said the sultan to Zeba.

67
00:04:36.327 --> 00:04:39.648
"Aladdin will marry Princess Badra!

68
00:04:40.929 --> 00:04:42.509
Go and tell him this news.

69
00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.731
And tell him to come to me at once.

70
00:04:46.471 --> 00:04:48.612
I want to meet my future son-in-law!"
